      <section id="settings-panel-table" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="settings-tab-table" class="setup-section settings-panel" hidden><p>Your playmat lies under your battlefield, and friends at your table see it too. Pick a preset, match your commander’s colours, or upload your own image (it stays on this device; friends receive a small copy).</p><div id="lobby-playmat"></div></section>
